tchboards and fittings, plywood, shuttering ply, power and hand tools, PVC pipes, sanitary ware, roofing sheets, and water storage tanks, as well as flooring materials, such as marble, granite, and semi-precious stones through its retail stores under UltraTech Home Expert Store brand name. In addition, the company operates mobile concrete labs that offers on-ground technical assessment of construction materials; and provides Vaastu, pest control, and water testing services, as well as home loans. It offers its products under UltraTech D\u00e9cor, DuraFacad, Pervious, MaxSheen, AquaSeal, ThermoCon+, FreeFlow+, FireSafe, DuraPlus, CorroProtect, Litecon, iFloors, Rapid, and ZIP brands. The company was incorporated in 2000 and is based in Mumbai, India. UltraTech Cement Limited operates as a subsidiary of Grasim Industries Limited."}}